{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49193","headline":"八六子 · 杜牧","name":"八六子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞房深，画屏灯照，山色凝翠沈沈。\n听夜雨，冷滴芭蕉，惊断红窗好梦，龙烟细飘绣衾。\n辞恩久归长信，凤帐萧疎，椒殿闲扃。\n辇路苔侵，绣帘垂，迟迟漏传丹禁。\n蕣华偷悴，翠鬟羞整，愁坐望处，金舆渐远。\n何时彩仗重临，正消魂，梧桐又移翠阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}